{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock a World - Island by Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break bottles to make islands emerge from the sea of clouds and gradually expand the world. New chunks of land will hold new secrets, challenges and more bottles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607380/extras/findbottles.gif?t=1744203924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Momentum-Based Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your momentum to reach blazing speeds! Make optimal use of spinning, diving and sliding down hills to unlock the maximum potential of your movement and finish the game in record time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607380/extras/momentum.gif?t=1744203924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with Friends </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the entire game either solo or with up to 4 friends. Simply invite people to your game world and explore together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607380/extras/multiplayer.gif?t=1744203924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Short but Sweet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a compact but re-playable journey that can be beaten in about 30 minutes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607380/extras/short.gif?t=1744203924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dress up the little guy with hats, accessories, scarf colors and paint-jobs. Unlock new cosmetics through exploration and challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607380/extras/style.gif?t=1744203924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\